icit blocker/review queue states on SourceFigureAsset nodes and question-to-asset edges.\n- Added focused tests for 858 visual-required count conservation and raw VLM candidate evidence not unlocking student display.\n\n## Artifact paths\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-runtime-spine.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-runtime-spine.schema.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-runtime-spine.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-runtime-spine.readback.md`\n- `scripts/method-map/build-v1-runtime-kg-spine.mjs`\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-v1-runtime-spine.test.js`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Graph mode: `question_paper_source_document_figureasset_receipt_spine`\n- Nodes: `5411`; edges: `8077`; postures: `3530`; canonical sources: `15`\n- Question nodes: `3530`; Paper nodes: `432`; SourceDocument nodes: `432`\n- SourceFigureAsset nodes: `858`; SourceVisualReceipt nodes: `159`\n- Question -> SourceFigureAsset edges: `858`; SourceFigureAsset -> SourceVisualReceipt edges: `159`\n- Visual-required rows represented: `858 / 858`\n- Accepted SourceVisualReceipt rows: `159`\n- Explicit visual blocker rows: `699`\n- Terminal blocker classes: `manual_crop_required=640`, `human_visual_review_required=58`, `missing_source_visual_receipt=1`\n- Asset production-ready rows: `159`; visual QA accepted rows: `159`\n- Rights display allowed rows: `0`; final student-display eligible visual rows: `0`\n- Raw VLM candidate runtime consumption rows: `0`; raw VLM candidate student-display unlock rows: `0`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n  - final output: `top_status=warning`; `worktree.dirty=false`; `branch=feat/issue-1284`; `head=a59be2e30`; `upstream_sync=healthy`; `report_artifact_guard=healthy`; `a_plus_ratchet=healthy`; only warning was branch naming/ownership (`branch_safety=warning`).\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-v1-runtime-kg-spine.mjs`\n  - output: exit `0` with no syntax errors.\n- `n